  {
    "episode_id": 80518,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80518.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "Oh, gosh. Okay. Well, so I'm going to explain my district a little bit just for perspective. In the state of Illinois, there are 18 congressional districts. Of those 18, we have 13 Democrats and five Republicans. And then of the 13 Democrats, 12 are in Chicago land. And I would be the 13th. So when you said I'm one of the only members of the",
