    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80518.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 23,
    "turn_text": "Do you think that's a possibility given just how damaging the last decade plus of scorched earth politics has been? I mean, it's not as if we have a foundation left to build on what happens the morning after the November 3rd election. And I'm not taking it on faith that Donald Trump will be removed from office, but should he be? How do you begin rebuilding that trust between two sides that have been at each other's throats?",
