        "text": "A functioning democracy requires more than just public sentiment to ensure legitimacy.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The credibility of elections depends on institutional safeguards beyond popular opinion.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the DCCC as having a relevant role in addressing democratic threats.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There are significant threats to democracy leading up to the November 3rd election.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
